::: {.fs-80}
| The change between the cohorts, Model 2 refitted | Log scale | *p* |
|:--|--:|--:|
| Non-Hispanic white women: the period coefficient, the number of the claim | −0.69 | < 0.0001 |
| Black women: the period coefficient plus its interaction | −0.40 | 0.134 |
| Hispanic women | −1.14 | < 0.001 |
| Other women | −1.61 | 0.010 |
| All cohabitors, the same model without the interaction | −0.73 | < 0.0001 |
