| A ratio of monthly chances, exp(*b*) | 0.48 |
| Partial *r* by the rule of Multi100, from the conventional *z* and 33,197 person-months | −0.047 |
:::

::: {.fragment .small}
The published result converts to *r* = −0.021. The recorded *r* of the five analysts run from −0.027 to 0.900: the 0.900 of 73FDT comes from a regression on five points, and the 0.044 of 5X3KG carries no sign, because a $\chi^2$ has none.
